# <%= current_page.data.title %>

You can manage your projects from the [Justice Data Platform's Projects dashboard](https://data-platform.service.justice.gov.uk/app/projects/). You'll
only be able to make changes to projects you own or have been given permission to manage.

Once you select a project, you can:

* see information about the project, including its Project ID
* add or remove members
* manage and create API keys for the AI gateway
* update which models you can use with an API key
* view a costs breakdown for the project, including AI model usage

